    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Rules Committee Resolution H. Res. 470 Reported to House. Rule provides for consideration of H.R. 3824 with 1 hour and 30 minutes of general debate. Previous question shall be considered as ordered without intervening motions except motion to recommit with or without instructions. Measure will be considered read. Specified amendments are in order.",
